  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAIN MILL-MUGHAN DRAINAGE CANAL PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE MAIN OBJECTIVE OF THE PROJECT IS TO DRAIN A NET AREA OF 300,000 HA OF AGRICULTURAL LAND FROM SALINE AND MINERALISED GROUNDWATER BY CONSTRUCTION OF THE MAIN MILL_MUGAN COLLECTOR CANAL. THIS WOULD BE REALIZED BY EXCAVATION OF A 140.9 KM LONG MAIN COLLECTOR CANAL,EXCAVATION OF 45 KM LONG BRANCH COLLECTOR CANALS AND CONSTRUCTION OF HYDRAULIC STRUCTURES. THESE EFFORTS WILL RESULT IN HIGHER AGRICULTURAL PRODUCTION.</narrative>
  </description>
